### List seats
GET http://localhost:5000/api/seats?page=1&limit=10

### Search seats
GET http://localhost:5000/api/seats?q=A

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/seats/seats-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/seats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "row": "A",
  "number": 2,
  "category": "Classic",
  "price": 180,
  "status": "available"
}
